      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "In a right triangle, the adjacent side to angle θ is 12 and the hypotenuse is 13. Find cos θ and tan θ.",
      "ja": "直角三角形で、角 θ の隣辺が 12、斜辺が 13 のとき、cos θ と tan θ の値を求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
